  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "For more complicated camera systems, being able to swap the options on the Cinemachine Brain component such as \"Default Blend\" and the time these transitions happen at is paramount. You can \"technically\" keyframe any of these options and handle it through animations, but this is \"bad\" and \"cringe.\"\nPlus, just being able to toggle the component on and off through script would be phenomenal.",
